pace: normal;min-height: 1em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"padding: 10px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;display: inline-block;width: 562px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: transparent;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           它是铁皮卡的自然变种，由单一基因变异而造成（侏儒化），因树形矮小，可高密种植并获得较高产量，1949年发现于危地马拉圣罗莎州（Santa Rosa）圣克鲁斯娜兰优（Santa Cruz Naranjo)地区的布里托（Brito）农场。\n          </span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 10px 8px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;min-height: 1em;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: normal;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"padding: 10px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;display: inline-block;width: 562px;border-width: 1px;border-style: solid;border-color: transparent;background-color: rgb(239, 239, 239);overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           在海拔高于1200米，且年降雨量低于2500毫米地区适适应性最强。拣选Pache的过程也是先优选出一批表现优异的植株，然后收集这群植株的种子，培育出新一代，再重复这个过程。密集优选最初只在危地马拉的农场进行，随后才传向其它国家和地区。\n          </span>\n<strong style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 12px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            现在已在边际接壤的墨西哥恰帕斯州地区种植并且生长。\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TlwKvv9ibDJC4Hibsia7koVKIia2U3D8ezrsSTdTXf8gmtITK5jaoL6tXticfZLUAiaanXUnrBr2iaKV0tQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这只咖啡来自圣拉斐尔小镇，镇上有26户咖农，每年可产20-25吨的咖啡豆，帕奇Pache品种也是圣拉斐尔的明星，它2019年墨西哥的CoE竞赛利获得了第二名的战绩。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今年的批次采取了厌氧发酵的方式，采摘红果后先用水来复选剔除一些杂质和不好的果子，然后倒入密封仓开始持续96小时的厌氧发酵。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TlwKvv9ibDJC4Hibsia7koVKI60NeXicjUqMRhEibibRlrNC1Jy9KdMSZuRNSP6Ifh7GoyIPPRTWxJP4cQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           晾晒过程\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在采收期的考米坦日晒场，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          白天有着晴朗的天气，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          能让咖啡豆均匀的进行干燥\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          到了晚上，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          咖啡樱桃得到了休息，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          豆子\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          里剩余的水分子会重新分布均匀，\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          等待隔天的进一步日晒。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          日晒的周期要持续10～15天\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TlwKvv9ibDJC4Hibsia7koVKI8Ms4pJBeia26iaBFDP2fKEd53qqWTArgrdXABvhjOKW7u88wCo13bBqw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多豆豆选购，可进入小程序或者淘宝商铺\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDw